              "heading": "Course Catalog 2024–2025"
            },
            "text": "The Department of Management offers a comprehensive suite of undergraduate (B.B.A.) and graduate (M.B.A.) courses. Below is the complete listing of all Management courses, along with course descriptions, prerequisites, and credit hours."
          }
        ],
        "sections": [
